course: dictionary
lesson: 2853
title: Context clues for a word from the sea
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words name a creature you may never have seen. The words around them give you clues. «Soft Pau Amma cannot leave Pusat Tasek, because sharks and dogfish would eat him.» The sentence puts dogfish next to sharks and says they would eat him, so a dogfish must be a sea creature that hunts other animals.
explain: Ask yourself: what would fit in this spot? Could a dogfish be a plant, a house or a person? No. Then swap your meaning into the sentence to check it still makes sense.
explain: The name gives a clue too: dog and fish. A dogfish is a kind of small shark, and sharks are fish, so the name fits. Some words have more than one meaning, though. The name also belongs to other fish, such as the bowfin of North American lakes, so read the sentence carefully to see which one it means.
fact: A dogfish is a kind of small shark.
fact: Dogfish live in seas around Britain, Europe and North America, and often have spotted skin.
fact: A dogfish lays eggs in cases called «mermaid's purses», and these often wash up on beaches.
fact: In British fish shops, dogfish is sometimes sold as «rock salmon» or «huss».
fact: Some other fish have the name dogfish too, such as the bowfin of North American lakes.
exercise: «Soft Pau Amma cannot leave Pusat Tasek, because sharks and dogfish would eat him.» What kind of creature is a dogfish? | A kind of dog that swims | A bird that nests on cliffs | *A small shark | A plant that grows in ponds
exercise: On a beach you find an empty case called a «mermaid's purse». What is it? | A purse made for mermaids in a shop | *The egg case of a dogfish | A shell from a crab | A piece of plastic from a boat
exercise: In a British fish shop, dogfish may be sold under which other name? | *Rock salmon | Bluebottle | Goldfish | Sea horse
test: In the sentence «sharks and dogfish would eat him», which word next to dogfish is a clue that it is a sea animal? | Cannot | Pusat | Him | *Sharks
test: The name dogfish also belongs to a fish in North American lakes. Which fish is it? | *Bowfin | Carp | Trout | Salmon
exam: Dogfish has more than one meaning. What should you do when a sentence does not show which fish it means? | Change the word to sharks | *Read the words around it for clues, then check a dictionary if needed | Skip it and never look again | Guess a random fish
